      499.4,
      286.84,
      605.85
    ],
    "text": "My No. : BD/BD/LND/3/5/29. Ref. No. of the Ministry of Lands : 4-3/9/2013/WS/29. I, hereby give notice to the public under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, the land/servitude described below is required by the government and the government intends to acquire the said land for a public purpose :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      605.39,
      286.65,
      720.23
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land/servitude to be acquired : The land called Wewassawette, Kurundu Kelewatte of 0.1012 Hectare in extent in the preliminary plan dated 07.07.2020 and in the sheet number 70, supplement number 75 of F.V.P. 170, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in Wedigune Village, 80H GlenAlphin Grama Niladhari Division, in Badulla Divisional Secretary Division of Badulla District in the Province of Uva. The Schedule 1 including below mentioned boundaries and block of lands. :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
